  <data key="d3">Hinduism</data>
  <data key="d4">Second and main day of Pongal. Rice is boiled in milk in new pots until it overflows (symbolizing abundance). The Sun God (Surya) is worshipped. 'Pongal-o-Pongal!' is chanted when the pot overflows.</data>
