  <data key="d4">The great night of Lord Shiva. Devotees observe a night-long vigil (jagaran) at Shiva temples. Fasting, offering milk and bel leaves to Shivling, and chanting 'Om Namah Shivaya'. Major celebrations at Kashi Vishwanath, Somnath, and other Jyotirlinga temples.</data>
